<title>GREECE: Greek 1M ATHIBOR unchanged at 12.34 pct.</title>
<headline>Greek 1M ATHIBOR unchanged at 12.34 pct.</headline>
<text>
<p>ATHENS, Jan 15 Reuter) - The Athens Interbank Offered Rate (Athibor) for one month was unchanged at 12.34 percent on Wednesday and the bid rate (Athibid) was flat at 11.84 percent.</p>
